{
  "id": "2SA.23",
  "number": "23",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Sam 23",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebigambo eby'okumalirra, Daudi ebiyagambire",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binu nibyo ebigambo eby'okumalirra Daudi ebiyagambire; Binu nibyo ebigambo ebya Daudi mutabani wa Yese, ebigambo by'Omusaija ayakuziibwe muno, Ruhanga wa Yakobbo ou yakomere ateere engoma, kandi ayahandiikiire Isirairi ebizina ebirungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owa kasatu ha basatu bali abaranganwa, nuwe Sama mutabani wa Ageye, Omuharali, Abafirisiti bakeesorooleza Leehi, nambere hakaba hali omusiri ogwijwire enkoole, Abaisirairi bairuka Abafirisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Sama yayemerra omumusiri, yagurwanirra, yaita Abafirisiti, ha kiro eki, MUKAMA nabwo yasingura muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe ky'Abafirisiti obukikaba kitiire orukande omukyeya eky'Abarefaimu, ha basaija amakumi asatu abakuru hagendaho basatu baahikaho Daudi nk'omukasumi ak'igesa, baamusanga omubwingira obwa Aduraamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukasumi ako, Daudi akaba ali omukigo; kandi ihe erya Abafirisiti, likaba liri Beterehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yagamba n'ekihika ati: “Ha, boojo, omuntu abaire kumpa amaizi g'okunywa ag'iziba erya Beterehemu erinyakuli haihi n'irembo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaija bali abasatu ab'amaani nubwo baahagwire orukande rwa Abafirisiti, baataha amaizi omwiziba erya Beterehemu erikaba liri haihi n'irembo, baagamutwarra. Baitu amaizi ago ataganywe, okwakubaire kuganywa, akagaseesa kibe kihongwa kya MUKAMA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yagamba ati: “MUKAMA, nikikafuuhe nyowe kunywa amaizi ganu! Naakubaire nt'anywire esagama ey'abasaija abo abaahoiremu obwomeezi bwabo!” Eki nikyo kyamutangire kuganywa. Ebi nibyo ebintu abasaija abasatu ab'amaani ebibaakozire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisayi owanyina Yowabbu mutabani wa Zeruya, nuwe akaba ali mukuru wa bali amakumi asatu, akarwanisa abasaija ebikumi bisatu n'icumu lye, yabaita, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaba muranganwa okukira amakumi asatu bali, kandi yafooka ngabwa yabu, baitu atainganaingane n'abasatu bali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaaya mutabani wa Yehoyaada, ayarugire Kabuzeeri, ayakozire ebintu bingi ebikuru, otaireho n'okwita abaserikale babiri aba Mowabbu, akaba ali musaija emanzi. Kiro kimu, obuhakaba hagwire ebirika, akagenda yaita entale yagiitira omubuhya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi akaita n'Omunyamisiri, omusaija owakaba asemiire aina icumu; Benaaya yamugendera akwasire omwigo, yamujakuraho icumu lye eryakaba akwasire, niryo yamwisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu ebi, Benaaya mutabani wa Yehoyaada nibyo yakozire, yaba muranganwa okukira abasaija bali abasatu ab'amaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba murangaanwa ha makumi asatu, baitu ataingane n'abasatu. Daudi nukwo kumuha okurolerra abaserikale be abalinzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banu nubo abantu abandi hali bali amakumi asatu: Asaheeri owanyina Yowabbu, Erihanani mutabani wa Dodo owa Beterehemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sama owa Harodi, Erika owa Harodi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Herezi Omuparuti, Ira mutabani wa Ikesi owa Tekoha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abyezeri wa Anasosi, Mebunahi Omuhuusi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zarumoni owa Ahohi, Maharahi owa Netofa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Herebu mutabani wa Bbaana owa Netofa, Itaayi mutabani wa Ribayi owa Gibeha ey'ab'oruganda rwa Bbenyamiini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaaya owa Pirasoni, Hidaayi ow'omu busaaru bwa Gaasi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiyaliboni Omurubasi, Azimavesi owa Bahulimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eryahaba owa Salibooni, batabani ba Yaseni, Yonasaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sama Omuharati, Ahyamu owa Sara omuharaki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erifereti mutabani wa Ahasibayi owa Maaka, Eryamu mutabani wa Ahisofeeri owa Giro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heziro owa Karumeeri, Parayi Omwarubi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igaali mutabani wa Nasani owa Zoba, Bbaana Omugaadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zereki Omumooni, Naharayi owa Beeroosi, ayayetwekaga ebyokurwanisa bya Yowabbu mutabani wa Zeruya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ira Omwisiri, Galebu Omwisiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
